"P2422291188" "Good day, {VillainName}. Certain recent actions by a group known as the Legacy Chain have caused me aggravation. They believed that I possessed something that they construed as 'evil', and so liberated it from my possession. Said item is near and dear to my heart and so I would like a talented soul to get it back for me. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Retrieve the Loa Bone from the Legacy Chain and bring it back to me</A>."
